  "solution": {
    "text": "Assuming that no 2s-2p mixing takes place<br/><br/>(i)      <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>  (diamagnetic)<br/><br/>(ii)     <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>  (diamagnetic)<br/><br/>(iii)    <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">*</mi></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi